    "name": "Qlik Sense Enterprise Qlik Sense Licenses License Audit API",
    "description": "REST API endpoints within the Qlik Sense Repository Service for managing licenses, license allocations, and user access types in Qlik Sense Enterprise. This API enables programmatic management of license enablement files (LEF), access type rules, and user license assignments including Professional, Analyzer, and Token access types.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Qlik Support",
